1633	## Closure
1634	
1635	Evaluate only the obligations applicable to the exact selected outcome and
1636	engagement branch. A listed frame or available testing family does not make
1637	its claim applicable. Every applicable obligation must be satisfied with valid
1638	evidence and required J/O, with no active non-closure condition under
1639	`TICKET_METHOD.md#condition-based-closure-and-reuse`. A closed indeterminate
1640	result or a review event does not satisfy an unresolved obligation.
1641	
1642	A project has applied this baseline to one outcome when:
1643	
1644	1. existing project authority admits and projects the exact frame basis;
1645	2. the complete selected STDO and Reference Frame Method remain the governing
1646	   sources;
1647	3. Executive, Worker, and Reviewer are available finite evaluation frames,
1648	   activated only where applicable, not hierarchy or actor identities;
1649	4. activation refusal remains distinct from Worker results, and every Worker
1650	   result maps exclusively from one closed Reference Frame Method result and
